## Project Overview

ShredNote is currently a Flutter application in an early prototype stage. The
implemented UI is a desktop-style workspace with a dark left sidebar and a blank
main workspace area. The active feature is a vertically scrollable paper
carousel in the left sidebar where new "paper" items can be created, selected,
focused, and browsed with snapping.

The project still uses mostly default Flutter project metadata and platform
scaffolding. Product behavior is concentrated in the Dart files under `lib/`.

